  "match_reasoning_secondary_crosscheck": "NS is unique in its genus (rank 19, signature (1, 18), cyclic discriminant group of order 20, Huybrechts Thm 1.5 bound ell+2=3<=rk=19 holds). The explicit candidate U(+)E8(-1)^2(+)<-20> has identical exact genus data (rank, signature, discriminant form all checked equal, not merely isomorphic-in-principle) and is block-diagonal with U as its first summand by construction. By genus uniqueness, NS = T^perp is isometric to this candidate, hence NS contains U as an orthogonal direct summand.",
